  "source": "Synthetic stand-in for Microsoft Graph, read from the group side. For each object ID in groups.yaml: GET /groups/{id}?$select=id,displayName and GET /groups/{id}/transitiveMembers?$select=id,userPrincipalName,displayName, whose list is flat and holds users, groups, devices and service principals. The last entry is what GET /groups?$filter=displayName eq 'lm-vault-break-glass' also returns: a second group with a tracked name.",
